# Authentication System Guide

Authentication is handled via JWT tokens in [server/api/auth/login.post.js](mdc:server/api/auth/login.post.js):

- Users log in with a username and password (hashed with SHA-256)
- On success, access and refresh JWT tokens are generated and set as HTTP-only cookies
- User roles are loaded from the database and included in the token payload
- The system supports role-based access control and secure session management

See the login endpoint for implementation details.
